          "desc": "Create PID overlay staging table from Contributing Heritage Resources for POSSE",
          "note": "For Ken Larade (PLAN and DEV, Transformation and Innovation). Discussed with Tristan Marvin, Somya also to be included. 1) Create new PID overlay staging table using LND_parcel_polygon and LND_heritage_contributing_resources, only records from LND_heritage_contributing_resources where Status = 'Approved'. Proposed table name: PID_HERITAGE_CONTRIB_RESOURCE (unconfirmed). Fields: PID (varchar8), HCR (varchar50, populated for records meeting 'Heritage Contributing Resources' conditions). 2) In POSSE.EXTERNALPARCEL, append values from the new staging table to the HERITAGEPROPERTYDISTRICT field. Example: PID 00093922 -> HERITAGEPROPERTYDISTRICT: 'Schmidtville; Heritage Contributing Resources'. Reach out to Ken & Tristan with questions.",
